<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#Inline> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n        :my-emphasis a po:Inline ;\n                po:isContainedBy :my-paragraph ;\n                po:contains :my-atom-text .\n        " .
